(446, 1, 'package', '{\"name\":\"Team Plan\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Portfolio\\\\Models\\\\Package\",\"slug\":\"team-plan\",\"slug_id\":\"90\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"All the basics for businesses that are just getting started.\",\"content\":\"<h4>Basic Plan<\\/h4><p>Our Basic Plan is designed for startups and small businesses looking to establish a strong foundation. With this plan, you\'ll get:<\\/p><ul><li>Essential Tools: Access to fundamental business tools and resources.<\\/li><li>Cost-Effective: Affordable pricing tailored to smaller budgets.<\\/li><li>24\\/7 Support: Assistance whenever you need it to kickstart your journey.<\\/li><li>Scalability: Option to upgrade as your business grows.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>The Basic Plan is the perfect choice for those taking their first steps in the business world.<\\/p><h4>Team Plan<\\/h4><p>Our Team Plan is ideal for growing businesses that require collaboration and efficiency. With this plan, you\'ll enjoy:<\\/p><ul><li>Collaborative Tools: Enhanced features for seamless team collaboration.<\\/li><li>Customization: Tailor the plan to fit your team\'s specific needs.<\\/li><li>Dedicated Support: Priority assistance to keep your team productive.<\\/li><li>Scalability: Flexibility to accommodate expanding teams.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>Choose the Team Plan to empower your growing business with the tools it needs to succeed.<\\/p><h4>Enterprise Plan<\\/h4><p>Our Enterprise Plan is designed for established businesses seeking advanced solutions and scalability. With this plan, you\'ll receive:<\\/p><ul><li>Advanced Features: Comprehensive tools for large-scale operations.<\\/li><li>Tailored Solutions: Customized to match your unique business requirements.<\\/li><li>Priority Support: Rapid response and support for mission-critical operations.<\\/li><li>Enterprise-Grade Security: Robust security measures to protect your data.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>The Enterprise Plan is your pathway to taking your business to the next level 