(585, 1, 'page', '{\"name\":\"workshop IT\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Page\\\\Models\\\\Page\",\"slug\":\"https:\\/\\/workshopit.info\",\"description\":null,\"content\":\"<shortcode>[hero-banner-slider title_1=\\\"Technology and Business Consultants\\\" title_2=\\\"Grow Your Start Up Now\\\" subtitle_1=\\\"We Are Expert In This Field\\\" subtitle_2=\\\"We Are Gerow\\\" description_1=\\\"In today\'s rapidly evolving digital landscape, the need for expert guidance in aligning technology with business goals has never been more critical. Workshop IT - Technology and Business Consultants stand out as a leading name in delivering innovative solutions that bridge the gap between technical advancements and strategic business growth.\\\" description_2=\\\"Gerow helps you to convert your data into a strategic asset and get top-notch business insights.\\\" button_label_1=\\\"Our Services\\\" button_url_1=\\\"\\/services\\\" button_label_2=\\\"Contact Us\\\" button_url_2=\\\"\\/contact\\\" image_1=\\\"sliders\\/banner-bg.jpg\\\" background_image_1=\\\"backgrounds\\/banner-shape.png\\\" image_2=\\\"sliders\\/banner-bg02.jpg\\\" background_image_2=\\\"backgrounds\\/banner-shape.png\\\" is_autoplay=\\\"no\\\" autoplay_speed=\\\"3000\\\"][\\/hero-banner-slider]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[company-overview style=\\\"style-6\\\" title=\\\"Changing The Way To Do Best IT &amp; Business Solutions\\\" subtitle=\\\"WHAT WE ARE DOING\\\" description=\\\"In a world driven by innovation and technology, businesses are continually seeking new ways to stay ahead of the competition. Workshop IT - Technology and Business Consultants is at the forefront of this evolution, reshaping how IT and business solutions are conceived, delivered, and implemented. Their approach is centered on transforming traditional methods into dynamic, future-ready strategies that enable organizations to thrive in a digital-first era.\\\" image=\\\"general\\/about-img01.png\\\" background_image=\\\"backgrounds\\/about-bg.jpg\\\